[aimspice]
[description]
746
Level shifter device currents
.include p18_cmos_models_ss.inc

* --- Input NMOS (MNLA/MNLB size), on current at the trip point ---
* Vgs = 0.4125 V (worst-case logic 1), Vds = 1.35 V
VG1 g1 0 0.4125
VD1 d1 0 1.35
M1 d1 g1 0 0 NMOS L=0.18U W=100U

* --- Input NMOS, leakage while holding the off state ---
* Vgs = 0.1375 V (worst-case logic 0), Vds = 1.8 V
VG2 g2 0 0.1375
VD2 d2 0 1.8
M2 d2 g2 0 0 NMOS L=0.18U W=100U

* --- Input NMOS, leakage at the trip point ---
* Vgs = 0.1375 V, Vds = 1.35 V
VG3 g3 0 0.1375
VD3 d3 0 1.35
M3 d3 g3 0 0 NMOS L=0.18U W=100U

* --- Pull-up PMOS (MPLA/MPLB size) at the trip point ---
* Vsg = 1.8 V (gate at 0 V), Vsd = 0.45 V
VS4 s4 0 1.8
VD4 d4 0 1.35
M4 d4 0 s4 s4 PMOS L=10U W=0.22U
[end]
